=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play logs/missing --------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's Logs screen (pkg/screens/logs), inferred$
# from v0.3.2 and origin/main, read from a simulated host by the$
# real reader (pkg/engine/logview). It only reads: no plan, no$
# y/N, no journal. No pager runs: Open says what hardn would$
# run. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and file$
# is the fake's.$
$
# Info: logs/missing$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13, less installed. No file$
# there. origin/main's main() makes it at every start as root,$
# before flags (cmd/hardn/main.go:57; logging.go:38), so today$
# this shows only where that open failed; next/p3-startup moves$
# that write.$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
  File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  No log yet$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter selection [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
  File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  No log yet$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter selection [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

